This program offers five choices to the user with the goal of giving them a more clear view of their finances. 
The first choice calculates yearly income, the second choice calculates yearly expenses, the third choice 
calculates how long in weeks it will take to make a certain quantity of money based on user income, the fourth choice
gathers monthly income and expenes and generates an HTML file inside the program directory allowing the user to choose the 
name of the file and when ran will generate a table (link to a free HTML editor-> https://www.w3schools.com/html/html_editor.asp) 
of the monthly income and expenses of the user and the last choice ends the program. Note that the exact numerical inputs as specified
(1, 2, 3, 4, 5) are required to select an option. All other numerical values can be entered as whole numbers or decimals. Enjoy!
